<!--
  Firebase sign-in for the online wallet (황금 붕어빵) and invitations.
  server_client_id is the "Web client (auto created by Google Service)"
  OAuth client ID of the Firebase project (Firebase console > Authentication >
  Sign-in method > Play Games, or Google Cloud console > Credentials).
